1
00:00:02,211 --> 00:00:04,046
- Is this the last scene?
- Yes

2
00:00:04,171 --> 00:00:05,589
This is the last one

3
00:00:05,714 --> 00:00:06,423
You're going
to a wrap party?

4
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:07,758
Sure

5
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:08,634
And on set today…

6
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:09,759
Hyesung

7
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:15,264
Sorry, I'm late

8
00:00:15,307 --> 00:00:16,307
Yoo-il

9
00:00:17,184 --> 00:00:18,685
How did you know
I'm here?

10
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:20,729
Your manager told me

11
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:22,294
I heard it's the last day
of shooting

12
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:23,815
Are you not happy
I'm here?

13
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:26,652
I'm just a bit cold

14
00:00:26,777 --> 00:00:27,777
Are you okay?

15
00:00:28,779 --> 00:00:30,614
It's cold outside, right?
Why don't you wait

16
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:32,574
somewhere warm
during shooting?

17
00:00:34,409 --> 00:00:35,994
No, I'm here
to watch the shooting

18
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,996
Hyesung
we're starting soon

19
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:38,789
Okay then…

20
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:41,041
Can you go get an iced
Americano for me?

21
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:41,959
You said you're cold

22
00:00:42,084 --> 00:00:43,084
Hyesung

23
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,719
Hwi-rim

24
00:00:55,097 --> 00:00:56,556
It was you

25
00:00:56,682 --> 00:00:59,184
All those moments
passed through me

26
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,309
was all you

27
00:01:09,695 --> 00:01:10,695
Cut!

28
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:14,283
Hyesung, what's wrong?

29
00:01:14,408 --> 00:01:15,951
Let's focus

30
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:16,743
Yeah

31
00:01:16,868 --> 00:01:18,120
Let's do it one last time

32
00:01:18,245 --> 00:01:19,538
Okay, keep roll!
This one too

33
00:01:19,663 --> 00:01:21,164
Okay, let's go!

34
00:01:21,290 --> 00:01:22,958
Two, three! Action!

35
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:24,584
All those moments
passed through me

36
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:27,879
was all you
